#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NAME			: denomdp020.scr
# DATE			: 21-07-2010
# DESCRIPTION		: This script performs the validation for the currency code
#			  that is been entered by the user in HCASHX menu option
# MENU OPTION		: HCASHX
# CALLING JSP		: denommn005.jsp
# AUTHOR NAME		: Sandeep Patil
# MODULE CODE		:	DENOM
# MODIFICATION HISTORY  :
#       <Serial.No>	<Date>		<AuthorName>		<Description>
